					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080317,
					"content": "おそらく…そうでしょう。将軍様と天領奉行の者は百個目の神の目の「目狩り儀式」を行い、目狩り令の段階的成果を証明したいのでしょう。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "神里綾華"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080318,
					"content": "…いけません、早く助けに向かわなければ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "神里綾華"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080319,
					"content": "ワンワン！ワン！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "太郎丸"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080320,
					"content": "落ち着いて。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080321
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20080321,
					"content": "でも「白鷺の姫君」は社奉行の代表。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20080322,
					"content": "そうだぞ、おまえが直接行ったら、社奉行が雷電将軍に敵対したことになっちゃうだろ？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080323,
					"content": "公の前で雷電将軍に抗えば、社奉行にいる普通の人も巻き添えになる…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080324,
					"content": "それも仕方のないことです…儀式がもう始まります、時間はありません。トーマをこのまま見捨てるわけには…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "神里綾華"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080325,
					"content": "彼は私の友人なのです。少し前までは…皆さん一緒にいたのに…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "神里綾華"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080326,
					"content": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYFIRST|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLFIRST]}の友達でもある、{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYFIRST|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLFIRST]}が助けに行く。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080327
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20080327,
					"content": "しかし…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "神里綾華"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080328,
					"content": "さっき言ってたでしょ、時間がないって。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080329
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20080329,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "神里綾華"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080330,
					"content": "はい…貴方がたのご無事を…祈っています！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20080331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "神里綾華"
				},
				{
					"id": 20080331,
					"content": "安心しろ、綾華。友達の命に関わることだ、オイラたちは絶対に失敗しない！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
